<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Génesis · Admin</title>



<style>
  /* =====================================================
     GÉNESIS — ADMIN DASHBOARD
     ===================================================== */

  :root {
    --bg: #354536;
    --bg-soft: #405441;
    --surface: #ffffff;
    --surface-2: #f5f7f2;
    --surface-3: #e9eee5;
    --surface-hover: #eef3e9;
    --border: #dce3d7;
    --border-strong: #c4d0bd;
    --text: #282923;
    --text-soft: #55564e;
    --muted: #77786f;
    --accent: #718363;
    --accent-hover: #5f7152;
    --accent-light: #eaf0e5;
    --success: #386b45;
    --success-bg: #edf6ee;
    --success-border: #c9e2cc;
    --danger: #a83e36;
    --danger-bg: #fdf0ee;
    --danger-border: #edcfca;
    --warning: #805d20;
    --warning-bg: #fbf5e7;
    --warning-border: #eadbb5;
  }

  *,
  *::before,
  *::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  html {
    min-height: 100%;
    background: var(--bg);
    color-scheme: light;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  body {
    min-height: 100vh;
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  main {
    width: min(1320px, calc(100% - 48px));
    margin: 36px auto 64px;
  }

  h1,
  h2,
  h3,
  h4 {
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.1rem);
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }

  main > h1 {
    color: #fff;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: 1.22rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  h4 {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  p {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .intro {
    margin: 8px 0 26px;
    color: #e0e7dc;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .section-lead {
    margin: -6px 0 22px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .small {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.83rem;
  }

  .hidden {
    display: none !important;
  }

  /* =====================================================
     SCHEDE GENERALI
     ===================================================== */

  .card {
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    padding: 26px;
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
    border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(21, 37, 23, 0.10);
  }

  .card h2 {
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .card .intro {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    color: var(--text-soft);
  }

  /* =====================================================
     PULSANTI
     ===================================================== */

  button {
    min-height: 40px;
    padding: 9px 15px;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    transition:
      background 0.18s ease,
      border-color 0.18s ease,
      color 0.18s ease,
      box-shadow 0.18s ease,
      transform 0.15s ease;
  }

  button:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background: var(--accent-hover);
    border-color: var(--accent-hover);
    box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(48, 61, 39, 0.12);
  }

  button:active:not(:disabled) {
    transform: translateY(1px);
  }

  button:focus-visible,
  input:focus-visible,
  textarea:focus-visible,
  select:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid rgba(113, 131, 99, 0.3);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  button.secondary {
    background: #fff;
    color: #41463e;
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
    box-shadow: none;
  }

  button.secondary:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border-color: #a8b0a0;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  button.danger {
    background: var(--danger-bg);
    color: var(--danger);
    border-color: var(--danger-border);
    box-shadow: none;
  }

  button.danger:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background: #f6dcd8;
    border-color: #dba9a2;
  }

  button:disabled {
    opacity: 0.48;
    cursor: not-allowed;
    box-shadow: none;
  }

  /* =====================================================
     CAMPI E FORM
     ===================================================== */

  input,
  textarea,
  select {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    min-height: 42px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    background: #fff;
    color: #292c27;
    border: 1px solid #d4d9d0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color-scheme: light;
    transition:
      border-color 0.18s ease,
      box-shadow 0.18s ease,
      background 0.18s ease;
  }

  input:hover,
  textarea:hover,
  select:hover {
    border-color: #a8b2a0;
  }

  input:focus,
  textarea:focus,
  select:focus {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    outline: none;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(113, 131, 99, 0.13);
  }

  input::placeholder,
  textarea::placeholder {
    color: #858b81;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  input[type="checkbox"],
  input[type="radio"] {
    width: auto;
    min-height: auto;
    accent-color: var(--accent);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  input[type="file"] {
    min-height: 42px;
    max-width: 100%;
    padding: 7px;
    background: #fff;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
  }

  input[type="file"]::file-selector-button {
    margin-right: 10px;
    padding: 7px 10px;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  textarea {
    min-height: 100px;
    resize: vertical;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    color: #484e45;
    font-size: 0.83rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .field {
    min-width: 0;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .grid-3 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 9px;
  }

  /* =====================================================
     NAVIGAZIONE PRINCIPALE
     ===================================================== */

  .tabs {
    position: sticky;
    top: 12px;
    z-index: 20;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    padding: 8px;
    background: #2c3b2d;
    border: 1px solid #52644f;
    border-radius: 13px;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(20, 36, 22, 0.12);
  }

  .tabs button {
    min-height: 42px;
    padding: 10px 17px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
  }

  .tabs button.active {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    border-color: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: none;
  }

  .tabs button.active:hover {
    background: var(--accent-hover);
    border-color: var(--accent-hover);
  }

  .tabs button:not(.active) {
    background: transparent;
    color: #e5ebe2;
    border-color: transparent;
    box-shadow: none;
  }

  .tabs button:not(.active):hover {
    background: #405441;
    color: #fff;
  }

  /* =====================================================
     SOTTOSEZIONI DEL MENU
     ===================================================== */

  .menu-layout {
    display: block;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .menu-subtabs {
    position: static;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    padding: 0;
    background: transparent;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 0;
    box-shadow: none;
  }

  .menu-subtab {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: auto;
    min-height: 40px;
    padding: 9px 16px;
    background: transparent;
    color: #e5ebe2;
    border: 1px solid #52644f;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .menu-subtab:not(.active) {
    background: #2c3b2d;
    color: #e5ebe2;
    border-color: #52644f;
  }

  .menu-subtab:not(.active):hover {
    background: #405441;
    color: #fff;
    border-color: #667b62;
  }

  .menu-subtab.active {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .menu-subtab.active:hover {
    background: var(--accent-hover);
    border-color: var(--accent-hover);
  }

  .menu-subtab:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid rgba(218, 231, 208, 0.55);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .menu-panels,
  .menu-panel {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .menu-panel {
    display: block;
  }

  .menu-panel.hidden {
    display: none !important;
  }

  .admin-content {
    display: none;
  }

  .admin-content.visible {
    display: block;
  }

  .tab-content {
    display: block;
  }

  .tab-content.hidden {
    display: none !important;
  }

  /* =====================================================
     MENU ADMIN — CARD PIATTI
     ===================================================== */

  #dishes-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .dish-row {
    min-width: 0;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    padding: 22px;
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(32, 33, 30, 0.045);
    transition: border-color 180ms ease, box-shadow 180ms ease;
  }

  .dish-row:hover {
    border-color: #cbd7c2;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(32, 45, 29, 0.08);
  }

  .dish-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 15px;
    min-width: 0;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .dish-head strong {
    min-width: 0;
    color: #292c27;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .dish-head .edit-dish {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .dish-editor {
    min-width: 0;
    margin-top: 18px;
    padding-top: 18px;
    border-top: 1px solid #e8ece4;
  }

  .dish-editor.grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    align-items: start;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .dish-editor .field {
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .dish-editor .field label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 7px;
    color: #62695d;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.45;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .dish-editor input,
  .dish-editor select,
  .dish-editor textarea {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .dish-editor textarea {
    min-height: 100px;
    resize: vertical;
  }

  .checkboxes {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px 16px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .checkboxes label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .checkboxes input {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: auto;
  }

  .checkboxes.dish-editor {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px 18px;
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding-top: 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid #e8ece4;
  }

  .checkboxes.dish-editor > label {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .checkboxes.dish-editor input[type="checkbox"] {
    width: auto;
    min-height: auto;
    accent-color: #627b55;
  }

  .checkboxes.dish-editor .delete-dish {
    margin-left: auto;
  }

  /* =====================================================
     EXTRA E ALLERGENI
     ===================================================== */

  .menu-info-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    align-items: start;
    gap: 22px;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .menu-info-card {
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 24px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e0e6da;
    border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 5px 18px rgba(32, 45, 29, 0.055);
  }

  .menu-info-card h2 {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    color: #252920;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .menu-info-card .section-lead {
    min-height: 0;
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    color: #72786c;
    font-size: 0.87rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  #extras-list,
  #allergens-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .menu-info-row {
    display: grid;
    align-items: end;
    gap: 12px;
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 14px;
    background: #f8faf6;
    border: 1px solid #e5eae0;
    border-radius: 12px;
    transition: background 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease;
  }

  .menu-info-row:hover {
    background: #fff;
    border-color: #cbd7c2;
  }

  .extra-row {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)) 100px auto;
  }

  .allergen-row {
    grid-template-columns: 76px repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)) auto;
  }

  .menu-info-row .field {
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .menu-info-row label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 7px;
    color: #62695d;
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .menu-info-row input {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    min-height: 42px;
    padding: 9px 10px;
    border: 1px solid #dce3d6;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #fff;
    color: #252920;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
  }

  .menu-info-row input:focus {
    outline: 2px solid rgba(98, 123, 85, 0.2);
    border-color: #829775;
  }

  .allergen-row .allergen-code {
    min-height: 40px;
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: 750;
    color: #40553a;
    background: #edf2e9;
    border-color: #d5dfce;
  }

  .allergen-row .allergen-name {
    font-weight: 550;
  }

  .menu-info-row .delete-extra,
  .menu-info-row .delete-allergen {
    min-height: 42px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  #add-extra,
  #add-allergen {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 43px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    border: 1px dashed #b9c8af;
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--accent-hover);
    box-shadow: none;
  }

  #add-extra:hover:not(:disabled),
  #add-allergen:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background: var(--accent-light);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  #save-extras,
  #save-allergens {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 46px;
  }

  #extras-status,
  #allergens-status {
    margin-top: 12px;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
  }

  /* =====================================================
     CATEGORIE E ORARI
     ===================================================== */

  .category-row,
  .hours-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 120px auto;
    align-items: end;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    padding: 15px;
    background: #f6f7f4;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
  }

  /* =====================================================
     POP-UP
     ===================================================== */

  .popup-row {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    padding: 20px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  /* =====================================================
     RICERCA PIATTI
     ===================================================== */

  .dish-search {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    align-items: end;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .dish-search .field {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .dish-search-buttons {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .dishes-count {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.83rem;
  }

  /* =====================================================
     IMPORTAZIONE EXCEL
     ===================================================== */

  .import-box {
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding: 20px;
    background: #f5f7f3;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .import-box h3 {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .import-box p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .import-file {
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .import-file input {
    background: #fff;
  }

  .import-summary {
    margin-top: 14px;
    padding: 14px;
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 9px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .import-summary strong,
  .import-summary-stat span {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .import-summary-title {
    margin-bottom: 7px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .import-summary-stats {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .import-summary-stat {
    display: flex;
    gap: 5px;
  }

  .import-preview {
    margin-top: 16px;
    overflow: auto;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 9px;
  }

  .import-preview table {
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 900px;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }

  .import-preview th,
  .import-preview td {
    padding: 9px 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e8ebe5;
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: top;
  }

  .import-preview th {
    background: #f2f4f0;
    color: #4d5349;
    font-weight: 700;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .import-preview td {
    background: #fff;
    color: #30342e;
  }

  .import-preview tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .import-error {
    background: var(--danger-bg);
    color: var(--danger);
    border-color: var(--danger-border);
  }

  .import-warning {
    background: var(--warning-bg);
    color: var(--warning);
    border-color: var(--warning-border);
  }

  .progress {
    height: 6px;
    margin-top: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #e2e6de;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .progress span {
    display: block;
    width: 0;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--accent);
    border-radius: inherit;
    transition: width 0.2s ease;
  }

  .import-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }

  .import-actions button {
    min-width: 140px;
  }

  .import-done {
    background: var(--success-bg);
    color: var(--success);
    border-color: var(--success-border);
  }

  .import-done strong {
    color: var(--success);
  }

  /* =====================================================
     HOMEPAGE — CARD PIATTI
     Anteprima a sinistra, editor a destra
     ===================================================== */

  #home-dishes-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 18px;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .home-dish-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(230px, 0.78fr) minmax(0, 1.5fr);
    align-items: start;
    gap: 24px;
    min-width: 0;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 22px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(32, 33, 30, 0.035);
  }

  .home-dish-row.is-unpublished {
    background: #f5f6f3;
    border-style: dashed;
    border-color: #c8cec2;
  }

  /* Anteprima sticky su desktop */

  .home-dish-preview {
    position: sticky;
    top: 88px;
    align-self: start;
    min-width: 0;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .home-dish-preview img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    object-fit: cover;
    background: var(--surface-3);
  }

  .home-dish-preview-copy {
    padding: 17px 18px 20px;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .home-dish-preview-meta {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: var(--accent-hover);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    line-height: 1.5;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .home-dish-preview h3 {
    margin: 0 0 9px;
    color: #292c27;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.6vw, 1.5rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.2;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .home-dish-preview p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #555b52;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .home-dish-preview-empty {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 140px;
    padding: 16px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Editor */

  .home-dish-editor {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    min-width: 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .home-dish-head,
  .home-dish-top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e8ebe5;
  }

  .home-dish-head strong,
  .home-dish-top strong {
    min-width: 0;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 1rem;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .home-dish-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    padding: 5px 9px;
    background: var(--accent-light);
    color: #4f6742;
    border: 1px solid #d2dfca;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.4;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .home-dish-badge.off {
    background: #edf0eb;
    color: #666d62;
    border-color: #dce1d8;
  }

  /* Campi */

  .home-dish-editor .field {
    min-width: 0;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .home-dish-editor .field label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    color: #62695d;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.45;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .home-dish-editor input:not([type="checkbox"]),
  .home-dish-editor select,
  .home-dish-editor textarea {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .home-dish-editor input[type="checkbox"] {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: auto;
    min-height: auto;
  }

  /* Griglie dei campi */

  .home-dish-editor > .grid,
  .home-dish-editor > .grid-3 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    align-items: start;
    gap: 12px;
    min-width: 0;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .home-dish-editor > .grid-3 {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  }

  .home-dish-editor > .grid > .field:only-child,
  .home-dish-editor > .grid-3 > .field:only-child {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }

  .home-upload-controls {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding-top: 4px;
  }

  .home-upload-controls input[type="file"] {
    display: block;
    max-width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 2px 0 4px;
  }

  .home-upload-controls button {
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .home-upload-filename,
  .dish-image-filename {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 4px;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  /* Immagine */

  .home-dish-file {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: start;
    gap: 8px;
    min-width: 0;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .home-dish-file input[type="file"] {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    max-width: 100%;
    padding: 7px;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }

  .home-dish-file button {
    justify-self: start;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .home-dish-status {
    min-width: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  /* Italiano, spagnolo e inglese */

  .home-dish-languages {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 10px;
    min-width: 0;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .home-dish-language {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 15px;
    background: #f5f6f3;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
  }

  .home-dish-language h4 {
    margin: 0;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    color: #555b52;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e1e6dc;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .home-dish-language .field {
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .home-dish-language textarea {
    min-height: 140px;
    resize: vertical;
    background: #fff;
  }

  /* Opzioni e pubblicazione */

  .home-dish-footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px 20px;
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid #e8ebe5;
  }

  .home-dish-footer label {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .home-dish-footer input {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: auto;
  }

  /* =====================================================
     MESSAGGI DI STATO
     ===================================================== */

  .status {
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding: 11px 13px;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    color: var(--text-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 9px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .status.success {
    background: var(--success-bg);
    color: var(--success);
    border-color: var(--success-border);
  }

  .status.error {
    background: var(--danger-bg);
    color: var(--danger);
    border-color: var(--danger-border);
  }

  .status.warning {
    background: var(--warning-bg);
    color: var(--warning);
    border-color: var(--warning-border);
  }

  /* =====================================================
     TABELLE
     ===================================================== */

  .table-wrap {
    overflow: auto;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
  }

  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
  }

  th,
  td {
    padding: 11px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e8ebe5;
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: top;
  }

  th {
    background: #f2f4f0;
    color: #4d5349;
    font-size: 0.79rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  td {
    background: #fff;
    color: #30342e;
  }

  tbody tr:hover td {
    background: #f7f9f5;
  }

  tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* =====================================================
     LOGIN
     ===================================================== */

  .login {
    max-width: 420px;
    margin: 90px auto;
    padding: 34px;
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
    border-radius: 17px;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(20, 36, 22, 0.14);
  }

  .login h1 {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  /* =====================================================
     RESPONSIVE — TABLET
     ===================================================== */

  @media (max-width: 1050px) {
    .menu-info-layout {
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .menu-info-card {
      padding: 18px;
    }

    .extra-row {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)) 85px auto;
    }

    .allergen-row {
      grid-template-columns: 68px repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)) auto;
    }

    .home-dish-row {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(190px, 0.68fr) minmax(0, 1.5fr);
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .home-dish-languages {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .home-dish-language {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      align-items: start;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .home-dish-language h4 {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    .home-dish-language .field:last-child {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }

  /* =====================================================
     RESPONSIVE — TABLET PICCOLI
     ===================================================== */

  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .tabs {
      position: static;
    }

    .menu-subtabs {
      position: static;
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }

    .home-dish-row {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .home-dish-preview {
      position: static;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 440px;
    }

    .home-dish-languages {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .home-dish-language {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .home-dish-language h4,
    .home-dish-language .field:last-child {
      grid-column: auto;
    }
  }

  /* =====================================================
     RESPONSIVE — MOBILE
     ===================================================== */

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    main {
      width: calc(100% - 24px);
      margin: 20px auto 40px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 1.65rem;
    }

    .card {
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }

    .grid,
    .grid-3,
    .hours-row,
    .category-row,
    .extra-row,
    .allergen-row {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .menu-info-layout {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .menu-info-card {
      padding: 18px;
    }

    .menu-info-card .section-lead {
      min-height: 0;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .category-row button,
    .hours-row button,
    .menu-info-row .delete-extra,
    .menu-info-row .delete-allergen {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .allergen-row .allergen-code {
      text-align: left;
    }

    #save-allergens,
    #save-extras {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .dish-row {
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .dish-head {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .dish-editor.grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .checkboxes.dish-editor .delete-dish {
      width: 100%;
      margin-left: 0;
    }

    .dish-search {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .dish-search-buttons {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .dish-search-buttons button {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .import-summary-stats {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .tabs {
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 7px;
    }

    .tabs button {
      flex: 1 1 auto;
      padding: 10px 11px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
    }

    .menu-subtabs {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 7px;
    }

    .menu-subtab {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 9px 8px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      white-space: normal;
    }

    .home-dish-row {
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 14px;
    }

    .home-dish-preview {
      max-width: none;
    }

    .home-dish-editor > .grid,
    .home-dish-editor > .grid-3 {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .home-dish-languages {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .home-dish-language {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      padding: 14px;
    }

    .home-dish-footer {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .home-dish-file button {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .login {
      margin: 42px auto;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .table-wrap {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }

  /* =====================================================
     ACCESSIBILITÀ — ANIMAZIONI RIDOTTE
     ===================================================== */

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    *,
    *::before,
    *::after {
      scroll-behavior: auto !important;
      transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
      animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
      animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
    }
  }
</style>


</head>

<body>

<!-- LOGIN -->
<section id="login-screen" class="login card">
  <h1>Génesis</h1>
  <p class="intro">Pannello di amministrazione</p>

  <div class="field">
    <label for="login-password">Password</label>
    <input
      id="login-password"
      type="password"
      autocomplete="current-password"
    >
  </div>

  <button id="login-button" type="button">Accedi</button>
  <div id="login-status" class="status hidden" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
</section>

<!-- ADMIN -->
<main id="admin-screen" class="admin-content">
  <h1>Génesis</h1>
  <p class="intro">Pannello di amministrazione</p>

  <!-- NAVIGAZIONE PRINCIPALE -->
  <nav class="tabs" aria-label="Sezioni principali">
    <button type="button" class="tab-button active" data-tab="menu" aria-selected="true">
      Menu
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="tab-button" data-tab="homepage" aria-selected="false">
      Homepage
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="tab-button" data-tab="popup" aria-selected="false">
      Pop-up
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="tab-button" data-tab="hours" aria-selected="false">
      Orari
    </button>
    <button type="button" id="logout-button" class="secondary">
      Esci
    </button>
  </nav>

  <!-- MENU -->
  <section id="tab-menu" class="tab-content">

    <!-- SOTTO-NAVIGAZIONE MENU -->
    <nav class="menu-subtabs" aria-label="Sottosezioni del menu">
      <button
        type="button"
        class="menu-subtab active"
        data-menu-panel="categories-panel"
        aria-selected="true"
      >
        Categorie
      </button>

      <button
        type="button"
        class="menu-subtab"
        data-menu-panel="dishes-panel"
        aria-selected="false"
      >
        Piatti
      </button>

      <button
        type="button"
        class="menu-subtab"
        data-menu-panel="extras-panel"
        aria-selected="false"
      >
        Extras e allergeni
      </button>

      <button
        type="button"
        class="menu-subtab"
        data-menu-panel="import-panel"
        aria-selected="false"
      >
        Importa carta da Excel
      </button>
    </nav>

    <!-- SOTTOSEZIONE CATEGORIE -->
    <div id="categories-panel" class="card menu-panel">
      <h2>Categorie</h2>
      <div id="categories-list"></div>

      <div class="actions">
        <button type="button" id="add-category">+ Aggiungi categoria</button>
        <button type="button" id="save-categories">Salva categorie</button>
      </div>

      <div id="categories-status" class="status hidden" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </div>

  
<!-- SOTTOSEZIONE PIATTI -->
<div id="dishes-panel" class="card menu-panel hidden">
  <h2>Piatti</h2>

  <div class="dish-search">
    <div class="field">
      <label for="dish-search">Cerca nei piatti</label>
      <input
        id="dish-search"
        type="search"
        placeholder="Nome, ingrediente, allergene..."
        autocomplete="off"
      >
    </div>

    <div class="dish-search-buttons">
      <button type="button" id="dish-search-button">
        Cerca
      </button>

      <button
        type="button"
        id="dish-search-clear"
        class="secondary"
      >
        Azzera
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="field">
    <label for="dish-category-filter">Categoria</label>
    <select id="dish-category-filter">
      <option value="">Tutte</option>
    </select>
  </div>

  <div
    id="dishes-count"
    class="dishes-count"
    aria-live="polite"
  ></div>

  <div id="dishes-list"></div>

  <div class="actions">
    <button type="button" id="add-dish">
      + Aggiungi piatto
    </button>

    <button type="button" id="save-dishes">
      Salva piatti
    </button>
  </div>

  <div
    id="dishes-status"
    class="status hidden"
    role="status"
    aria-live="polite"
  ></div>
</div>

    
    <!-- SOTTOSEZIONE EXTRAS E ALLERGENI -->
    <div id="extras-panel" class="menu-panel hidden">

      <div class="menu-info-layout">

        <!-- COLONNA 1: EXTRAS -->
        <section class="card menu-info-card">
          <h2>Extras del menú</h2>

          <p class="section-lead">
            Gestisci gli extra e i relativi prezzi mostrati in fondo al menu pubblico.
          </p>

          <div id="extras-list"></div>

          <div class="actions">
            <button type="button" id="add-extra">
              + Aggiungi extra
            </button>

            <button type="button" id="save-extras">
              Salva extras
            </button>
          </div>

          <div
            id="extras-status"
            class="status hidden"
            role="status"
            aria-live="polite"
          ></div>
        </section>

        <!-- COLONNA 2: LEGGENDA ALLERGENI -->
        <section class="card menu-info-card">
          <h2>Legenda allergeni</h2>

          <p class="section-lead">
            Gestisci i codici e le descrizioni mostrati nella legenda del menu.
            Le modifiche alla legenda non cambiano i codici allergeni
            associati ai singoli piatti.
          </p>

          <div id="allergens-list"></div>

          <div class="actions">
            <button type="button" id="add-allergen">
              + Aggiungi allergene
            </button>

            <button type="button" id="save-allergens">
              Salva legenda
            </button>
          </div>

          <div
            id="allergens-status"
            class="status hidden"
            role="status"
            aria-live="polite"
          ></div>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>


    <!-- SOTTOSEZIONE IMPORTAZIONE EXCEL -->
    <div id="import-panel" class="card menu-panel hidden">
      <h2>Importa carta da Excel</h2>

      <div class="import-box">
        <h3>Scarica modello Excel</h3>
        <p>
          Usa un file Excel con la struttura del modello per caricare rapidamente una nuova carta.
          Prima dell'importazione verrà mostrata un'anteprima dei dati.
        </p>

        <div class="import-actions">
          <button
            type="button"
            id="download-import-template"
            class="secondary"
          >
            Scarica modello Excel
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="import-file">
          <label for="import-file">Seleziona file Excel</label>
          <input id="import-file" type="file" accept=".xlsx,.xls">
        </div>

        <div
          id="import-summary"
          class="import-summary hidden"
          aria-live="polite"
        ></div>

        <div id="import-progress" class="progress hidden" aria-hidden="true">
          <span id="import-progress-bar"></span>
        </div>

        <div id="import-preview" class="import-preview hidden"></div>

        <div id="import-actions" class="import-actions hidden">
          <button type="button" id="import-button" disabled>Importa carta</button>
          <button type="button" id="import-cancel" class="secondary">Annulla</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HOMEPAGE — PIATTI -->
  <section id="tab-homepage" class="tab-content hidden">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Piatti in homepage</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">
        Gestisci le cinque card della sezione “PIATTI” della pagina iniziale.
        Puoi modificare immagini e testi in italiano, spagnolo e inglese, cambiare
        l’ordine e nascondere una card senza eliminarla. L’anteprima si aggiorna mentre scrivi.
      </p>

      <div id="home-dishes-list"></div>

      <div class="actions">
        <button type="button" id="save-home-dishes">Salva modifiche homepage</button>
        <button type="button" id="reload-home-dishes" class="secondary">Ricarica dati</button>
      </div>

      <div
        id="home-dishes-status"
        class="status hidden"
        role="status"
        aria-live="polite"
      ></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- POP-UP -->
  <section id="tab-popup" class="tab-content hidden">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Pop-up</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">
        Crea e programma l’avviso mostrato sul sito. Per renderlo visibile,
        attiva “Pubblicato” e verifica che le date siano corrette; lascia vuote
        le date per non limitarne il periodo.
      </p>

      <div id="popups-list"></div>

      <div class="actions">
        <button type="button" id="add-popup">+ Aggiungi pop-up</button>
        <button type="button" id="save-popups">Salva pop-up</button>
      </div>

      <div id="popups-status" class="status hidden" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ORARI -->
  <section id="tab-hours" class="tab-content hidden">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Orari</h2>
      <div id="hours-list"></div>

      <div class="actions">
        <button type="button" id="add-hour">+ Aggiungi orario</button>
        <button type="button" id="save-hours">Salva orari</button>
      </div>

      <div id="hours-status" class="status hidden" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </div>
